Machine profiles: hardware-only tweaks for one model. aadd offers a profile
when P_MATCH is found in the DMI product name/version
(/sys/class/dmi/id/product_{name,version}).
  profile.conf    P_MATCH plus AADD_* overrides (written into aadd.conf)
  xinitrc.local   optional, copied to ~/.config/aadd/xinitrc.local
No usernames, network names or keys here: this repo is public.
